WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.836
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.106 --> 00:02.524
[♪ opening theme song plays]

3
00:43.065 --> 00:48.070
THE PERFECT LIE

4
00:53.158 --> 00:54.743
THIS DRAMA IS A WORK OF FICTION

5
00:54.826 --> 00:58.080
SCENES INVOLVING CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS WERE FILMED SAFELY

6
01:00.248 --> 01:03.293
Of the two of you, the one who lied…

7
01:03.377 --> 01:04.419
[♪ unsettling music plays]

8
01:05.712 --> 01:07.172
…is you.

9
01:12.719 --> 01:13.970
But…

10
01:16.264 --> 01:17.265
you said yourself

11
01:18.225 --> 01:20.686
that lie detector results aren't always accurate.

12
01:22.229 --> 01:23.230
[sighs]

13
01:23.313 --> 01:25.357
Are you questioning the accuracy of the test?

14
01:25.440 --> 01:27.401
If you're unstable or extremely…

15
01:28.985 --> 01:30.237
extremely…

16
01:31.863 --> 01:35.450
extremely tired, the results can be wrong. You said that yourself.

17
01:35.534 --> 01:37.035
I took a sedative that day,

18
01:37.953 --> 01:39.788
so I wasn't thinking clearly.

19
01:40.539 --> 01:42.541
[Hwayoung] That sounds a lot like your statement.

20
01:42.624 --> 01:44.751
That your memory was hazy from drinking.

21
01:50.173 --> 01:51.758
I'll take it again. Please.

22
02:05.439 --> 02:07.190
Please don't let Min Junho know.

23
02:07.274 --> 02:09.526
You said it can't be used as evidence anyway.

24
02:17.909 --> 02:21.538
Everything from the investigation is documented in the police case file.

25
02:22.330 --> 02:24.666
We also have to inform Mr. Min of the results.

26
02:25.959 --> 02:29.546
This case will most likely be closed without charges due to lack of evidence.

27
02:31.423 --> 02:33.341
It is quite likely…

28
02:35.218 --> 02:37.471
that you'll have to pay the price for lying.

29
02:44.561 --> 02:46.188
No, wait. I…

30
02:53.403 --> 02:54.696
[sniffles]

31
02:54.780 --> 02:58.241
ANALYSIS INDICATED DECEPTIVE RESPONSES IN EXAMINEE

32
02:58.325 --> 02:59.618
Damn it.

33
02:59.701 --> 03:02.746
[breathing heavily]

34
03:02.829 --> 03:05.499
No, wait… Damn it.

35
03:05.582 --> 03:11.755
EPISODE 3 TWO FACES

36
03:13.006 --> 03:14.007
[attorney] From what I can tell,

37
03:15.008 --> 03:17.219
she isn't going to let this go easily.

38
03:18.011 --> 03:19.721
-[cork pops softly] -She'll take this all the way.

39
03:20.555 --> 03:21.556
[liquid pouring]

40
03:21.640 --> 03:22.891
And if she does?

41
03:22.974 --> 03:29.606
[attorney] The ones who've done it before know how to play the game.

42
03:30.148 --> 03:34.277
She knows how to pressure a man to get money out of him.

43
03:35.403 --> 03:37.197
She never mentioned money, though.

44
03:37.280 --> 03:42.786
Once she drags you all the way down, you'll end up paying just to make it stop.

45
03:42.869 --> 03:45.330
Then she'll go, "When did I ever ask you for money?"

46
03:45.413 --> 03:48.667
And she'll take the money anyway, declaring victory.

47
03:48.750 --> 03:50.669
That's how the pros do it.

48
03:52.087 --> 03:55.549
But once the investigation is over, there's nothing she can do, is there?

49
03:55.632 --> 03:58.385
[scoffs] You naive, clueless doctor.

50
03:59.052 --> 04:01.429
You think it's over just because the cops cleared you?

51
04:02.430 --> 04:05.517
Your reputation is the trial, and rumors are the punishment, get it?

52
04:05.600 --> 04:08.144
Especially for someone like you who's got so much to lose.

53
04:11.231 --> 04:15.235
[sighs] There must've been a reason for her to misunderstand me.

54
04:17.362 --> 04:18.363
Have you lost it?

55
04:19.030 --> 04:22.200
What, do you like her or something?

56
04:22.284 --> 04:23.493
What misunderstanding?

57
04:23.577 --> 04:26.162
Get a grip. Your reputation and your son are at stake here.

58
04:27.455 --> 04:28.456
Enough.

59
04:28.540 --> 04:30.750
Press charges for false accusation and defamation.

60
04:30.834 --> 04:32.878
You have to see it through until she gives up.

61
04:32.961 --> 04:34.921
Do we really have to go that far?

62
04:45.265 --> 04:46.850
You lied to me, didn't you?

63
04:48.852 --> 04:49.895
[Junho] I didn't.

64
04:50.645 --> 04:52.647
[attorney] Then what? Does she have something on you?

65
04:57.569 --> 04:58.737
I guess she does.

66
04:59.571 --> 05:00.822
Okay. What is it?

67
05:01.740 --> 05:02.741
She's…

68
05:04.576 --> 05:05.660
a teacher.

69
05:06.202 --> 05:07.412
I know she's a teacher.

70
05:09.122 --> 05:10.165
At Hyunsoo's school.

71
05:10.248 --> 05:11.958
[choking, coughing]

72
05:12.542 --> 05:13.752
She's his teacher.

73
05:16.838 --> 05:18.089
Hyunsoo doesn't know yet.

74
05:18.882 --> 05:21.927
If he happens to find out, it'll only hurt him more.

75
05:22.010 --> 05:24.179
[attorney] Man, that woman is scary.

76
05:24.262 --> 05:27.057
She's using your kid as leverage. This was totally planned.

77
05:27.140 --> 05:28.975
Come on, that's enough.

78
05:31.895 --> 05:33.438
Just wait and see.

79
05:33.521 --> 05:36.942
From here on out, that woman is going to play the victim for all it's worth.

80
05:37.484 --> 05:40.737
If you don't tie her hands legally, you'll be the one who loses.

81
05:41.488 --> 05:43.531
Do you think I'm lying too?

82
05:43.615 --> 05:44.783
[Jieun] No, but…

83
05:46.743 --> 05:48.745
I think it might be better to stop here.

84
05:49.746 --> 05:52.916
You want me to admit I lied? Now?

85
05:52.999 --> 05:55.835
-What if you misunderstood something? -Misunderstood?

86
05:55.919 --> 05:57.837
You'd been drinking when it happened,

87
05:57.921 --> 06:00.131
so maybe you don't remember everything clearly.

88
06:00.215 --> 06:01.841
Maybe that's why this says…

89
06:01.925 --> 06:04.302
POLYGRAPH TEST RESULTS

90
06:04.386 --> 06:05.470
[♪ somber music plays]

91
06:05.553 --> 06:07.847
No, this is all a lie.

92
06:09.224 --> 06:11.393
Come on, you have to get on with your life.

93
06:11.476 --> 06:14.187
How am I supposed to have a life after he ruined me like this?

94
06:14.270 --> 06:15.522
So now what?

95
06:18.608 --> 06:21.277
I'm going to ask them to reinvestigate everything.

96
06:21.861 --> 06:24.406
-Is that even possible? -Not you talking like that too!

97
06:24.489 --> 06:28.201
Then what? Tell you to go all the way without thinking about the consequences?

98
06:28.284 --> 06:30.453
I can't live with this being swept under the rug!

99
06:30.996 --> 06:32.872
If this whole thing gets quietly buried,

100
06:32.956 --> 06:35.625
Min Junho will never even know what he did wrong,

101
06:35.709 --> 06:37.627
and he'll laugh at me!

102
06:44.843 --> 06:46.845
[Jisun sobbing loudly]

103
06:56.312 --> 07:00.150
EXAMINEE MIN JUNHO'S RESPONSES WERE DETERMINED TO BE TRUTHFUL

104
07:01.651 --> 07:04.070
So now we know for sure.

105
07:06.448 --> 07:08.867
Those are just the polygraph results.

106
07:09.367 --> 07:11.161
The investigation isn't over yet.

107
07:12.370 --> 07:13.788
About Ms. Kang…

108
07:15.915 --> 07:19.002
Maybe there's something wrong with her psychologically.

109
07:19.544 --> 07:20.628
I'm worried about her.

110
07:21.629 --> 07:24.174
But of course, I can't even begin to describe the pain

111
07:24.257 --> 07:25.842
and suffering I've been through.

112
07:26.634 --> 07:28.344
I don't know what to say.

113
07:30.346 --> 07:32.682
I don't know if I can ever trust someone…

114
07:35.018 --> 07:36.436
wholeheartedly again.

115
07:38.521 --> 07:40.690
We'll be wrapping up the case soon.

116
07:43.109 --> 07:44.944
What's really unfortunate is…

117
07:47.864 --> 07:49.616
because of people like Ms. Kang,

118
07:51.201 --> 07:53.495
actual victims may end up staying silent out of fear

119
07:54.120 --> 07:58.458
that they'll be doubted and falsely accused like this.

120
08:04.172 --> 08:05.673
Well, I'll see you soon.

121
08:17.852 --> 08:18.895
[doctor 1] Hey, Dr. Min!

122
08:20.563 --> 08:22.023
Looking for another hospital?

123
08:22.607 --> 08:26.444
Man, what happened to our star doctor?

124
08:28.321 --> 08:29.489
Take it easy.

125
08:30.990 --> 08:32.951
[doctor 2] What a scumbag.

126
08:34.160 --> 08:35.537
[♪ unsettling music plays]

127
08:42.544 --> 08:46.131
FROM SANGCHEON POLICE STATION WOMEN &amp; JUVENILE AFFAIRS DIVISION

128
08:59.769 --> 09:01.688
Could I see the director for a moment?

129
09:03.314 --> 09:05.400
The foundation board members are here with him,

130
09:05.483 --> 09:08.027
so you'll have to come back after making an appointment.

131
09:08.111 --> 09:09.946
[keyboard clacking]

132
09:10.029 --> 09:11.030
Oh.

133
09:15.326 --> 09:16.327
[sighs]

134
09:17.537 --> 09:18.538
[rustling]

135
09:19.914 --> 09:21.374
[scribbling]

136
09:33.052 --> 09:34.053
[papers shuffling]

137
09:38.600 --> 09:40.435
Could you just give him this?

138
09:40.518 --> 09:42.896
Sure. If you leave it here, I'll give it to him later.

139
09:43.980 --> 09:44.981
I'll wait.

140
09:55.074 --> 09:56.367
[♪ softly stirring music plays]

141
09:56.868 --> 09:57.869
[paper flipping]

142
10:02.498 --> 10:06.878
EXAMINEE MIN JUNHO'S RESPONSES WERE DETERMINED TO BE TRUTHFUL

143
10:24.270 --> 10:25.271
[knocking]

144
10:32.904 --> 10:33.905
[door opens]

145
10:50.713 --> 10:53.174
[aide] Min Junho came to see the director on his own.

146
10:54.634 --> 10:55.677
[staff 1] Gross.

147
10:56.678 --> 10:58.137
[staff 2] Is he handing in his resignation?

148
10:58.846 --> 11:01.849
Look at him coming back here after getting hauled away in handcuffs.

149
11:01.933 --> 11:03.226
He's got some nerve.

150
11:03.309 --> 11:05.561
[aide] He brought his polygraph results.

151
11:05.645 --> 11:06.646
[staff 1] What's that?

152
11:07.146 --> 11:08.147
[aide] A lie detector.

153
11:09.315 --> 11:11.776
It says he wasn't lying. Looks like he got played by a gold digger.

154
11:11.859 --> 11:14.320
[gasps] No way.

155
11:15.613 --> 11:16.906
-What is it? -[staff 2] Well,

156
11:16.990 --> 11:19.409
it looks like Dr. Min got played by a gold digger.

157
11:19.993 --> 11:21.119
No way…

158
11:21.202 --> 11:22.495
What are you talking about?

159
11:22.996 --> 11:23.997
-Where? -[staff 2] Look.

160
11:24.080 --> 11:25.707
[aide] I guess she filed a false report.

161
11:26.541 --> 11:27.667
[staff 3] To extort money from him?

162
11:28.167 --> 11:30.545
[staff 4] So it was a false accusation. That's crazy.

163
11:30.628 --> 11:33.631
[staff 2 gasps] I feel so bad for Dr. Min.

164
11:33.715 --> 11:36.718
[staff 3] See? I told you Dr. Min would never do something like that.

165
11:40.346 --> 11:41.347
[phone rings]

166
11:44.058 --> 11:45.059
[aide] Yes.

167
11:46.352 --> 11:47.353
Yes, okay.

168
11:54.610 --> 11:58.072
The director says you can come in now.

169
11:58.614 --> 11:59.615
Okay.

170
12:01.826 --> 12:04.620
[staff sighs] I feel so bad for him.

171
12:06.039 --> 12:07.040
[sighs]

172
12:14.756 --> 12:16.090
-[thuds] -Oh, my gosh.

173
12:19.510 --> 12:21.262
[director] Hey, Professor Min.

174
12:21.346 --> 12:23.139
You came without an appointment?

175
12:23.222 --> 12:26.142
I'm sorry. I was just going to drop off the report and leave.

176
12:26.225 --> 12:29.270
Well, since you're here, you might as well meet everyone.

177
12:30.229 --> 12:34.859
Everyone, this is Professor Min Junho, one of the country's top cardiac surgeons.

178
12:34.942 --> 12:37.945
We get tons of VIP patients from China asking for him.

179
12:38.696 --> 12:40.573
He's our hospital's star doctor.

180
12:42.033 --> 12:43.034
[liquid pouring]

181
12:43.576 --> 12:45.870
SANGCHEON UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL MIN JUNHO

182
12:45.953 --> 12:49.457
[Junho] I'm sorry for causing you concern.

183
12:50.833 --> 12:52.293
If I may explain…

184
12:54.295 --> 12:56.089
Well, there's really nothing to explain.

185
12:56.172 --> 12:59.008
I just went on a normal date,

186
12:59.842 --> 13:01.677
and somehow it turned into all this.

187
13:02.553 --> 13:06.015
Well, you've certainly paid the price for being famous.

188
13:06.099 --> 13:08.434
You have to be careful of people.

189
13:09.685 --> 13:10.561
[Junho sighs]

190
13:10.645 --> 13:12.647
I wasn't careful enough.

191
13:13.940 --> 13:15.775
So is the police investigation over now?

192
13:17.860 --> 13:20.113
There's nothing more for them to investigate,

193
13:20.780 --> 13:22.532
so I think it's safe to say it is.

194
13:23.032 --> 13:26.285
Government agencies always take their sweet time with these things.

195
13:27.495 --> 13:30.998
You know our VIP Cardiovascular Center is opening later this year.

196
13:31.582 --> 13:33.209
You should join us, Professor Min.

197
13:35.086 --> 13:37.255
What would I be doing if I joined?

198
13:37.338 --> 13:39.465
Just keep doing what you're doing.

199
13:40.174 --> 13:43.553
We'll screen the patients,

200
13:43.636 --> 13:47.306
so all you need to do is maintain your reputation.

201
13:50.601 --> 13:54.397
I don't know about my reputation, but I'll make sure I keep my skills sharp.

202
13:56.274 --> 13:58.609
Thank you for trusting me.

203
13:58.693 --> 14:00.736
[chuckles] No need to thank me.

204
14:02.029 --> 14:05.575
But I don't trust you, sir.

205
14:07.994 --> 14:09.370
What are you talking about?

206
14:10.538 --> 14:12.540
You took me off all my surgeries and rounds

207
14:12.623 --> 14:14.542
before the investigation results were out.

208
14:15.751 --> 14:17.587
You were basically telling me to leave.

209
14:18.671 --> 14:21.465
If this were a private practice, that would be one thing.

210
14:21.549 --> 14:22.925
But this is different.

211
14:24.594 --> 14:28.097
These days, both the Medical Association and the Hospital Association…

212
14:28.181 --> 14:31.350
They take a dim view of such misconduct.

213
14:35.771 --> 14:40.067
So I committed misconduct.

214
14:47.033 --> 14:48.034
You little punk.

215
14:48.117 --> 14:51.370
Just because I call you "Professor," you think you can forget your place?

216
14:58.920 --> 15:01.214
[laughs] Geez, you little…

217
15:02.048 --> 15:05.843
Fine. I'll trust you no matter what happens from now on,

218
15:05.927 --> 15:08.095
so quit acting all sulky, you punk.

219
15:09.305 --> 15:11.390
Then I'm taking my patients back.

220
15:11.474 --> 15:12.683
Suit yourself.

221
15:12.767 --> 15:14.894
-And I'm going back into surgery. -Go ahead.

222
15:14.977 --> 15:16.604
Do whatever you want.

223
15:16.687 --> 15:17.688
Geez.

224
15:26.489 --> 15:27.490
Hello.

225
15:33.704 --> 15:35.164
-[nurse 1] Hello, Dr. Min. -[nurse 2] Hello.

226
15:45.132 --> 15:46.133
Dr. Min Junho.

227
15:49.053 --> 15:50.137
What is it?

228
15:53.891 --> 15:55.017
"What is it?"

229
15:55.101 --> 15:57.603
Right. What is it? Well…

230
16:00.731 --> 16:02.483
Shut your mouth and listen carefully.

231
16:04.110 --> 16:05.111
Excuse me?

232
16:06.487 --> 16:08.906
I know everything Kang Jisun said is true.

233
16:08.990 --> 16:10.324
[♪ unsettling music plays]

234
16:11.492 --> 16:12.660
You disgusting bastard.

235
16:13.244 --> 16:16.789
You might think you got away with it, but it won't be that easy.

236
16:17.290 --> 16:18.291
Do you understand?

237
16:20.459 --> 16:21.877
Have a nice day.

238
16:23.921 --> 16:25.131
Mr. Park Junghyeon.

239
16:28.926 --> 16:32.680
I don't think I'm the one who needs to watch out. You are.

240
16:33.264 --> 16:34.265
What?

241
16:36.976 --> 16:42.773
I know exactly what you've been doing and with whom all this time.

242
16:51.615 --> 16:53.826
If you're going to have secret rendezvous,

243
16:53.909 --> 16:56.579
I suggest you pick a more private location next time.

244
16:58.080 --> 17:00.374
There are plenty of empty rooms around the hospital,

245
17:01.042 --> 17:02.668
but they're still public spaces.

246
17:05.796 --> 17:07.048
Have a nice day.

247
17:12.511 --> 17:14.722
-[indistinct chattering] -[class bell rings]

248
17:26.609 --> 17:27.777
Who's not here?

249
17:27.860 --> 17:29.070
[student] Hyunsoo.

250
17:29.153 --> 17:30.154
Soyeon too.

251
17:32.114 --> 17:33.824
Does anyone know why they're late?

252
17:35.826 --> 17:37.620
[♪ lively pop music plays on phone]

253
17:39.413 --> 17:40.539
Aren't you heading in?

254
17:44.835 --> 17:46.879
Is it because of what happened with your dad?

255
17:48.464 --> 17:49.548
[♪ music stops]

256
17:49.632 --> 17:51.342
My dad didn't do anything wrong.

257
17:52.843 --> 17:54.220
Then why aren't you heading in?

258
17:55.805 --> 17:56.806
What about you?

259
18:00.309 --> 18:01.977
Let me borrow your account again.

260
18:06.440 --> 18:08.359
Why are you looking at me like I'm pathetic?

261
18:13.572 --> 18:14.699
[scoffs]

262
18:14.782 --> 18:16.242
What's this supposed to get me?

263
18:17.118 --> 18:18.119
Then earn it yourself.

264
18:19.954 --> 18:21.163
[Soyeon] You're so annoying.

265
18:22.039 --> 18:23.124
Where are you going?

266
18:23.207 --> 18:24.208
[Hyunsoo] The bell rang.

267
18:25.668 --> 18:26.669
[thuds]

268
18:28.295 --> 18:29.714
Hey, Kim Soyeon!

269
18:32.258 --> 18:34.093
-Hey! -[Jisun] Oh, dear. Soyeon!

270
18:35.845 --> 18:37.263
What happened?

271
18:38.222 --> 18:40.725
Did you even know what kind of pills they were?

272
18:42.601 --> 18:44.979
We have our monthly evaluation next week…

273
18:47.314 --> 18:48.858
and I haven't lost any weight.

274
18:53.404 --> 18:57.450
Those pills keep me from getting hungry.

275
18:59.160 --> 19:00.536
What?

276
19:00.619 --> 19:01.871
Where did you get them?

277
19:05.791 --> 19:08.169
Kids your age can't even get a prescription for those.

278
19:08.252 --> 19:10.588
They're dangerous even for adults. Now tell me.

279
19:12.590 --> 19:15.551
I won't take them ever again.

280
19:27.813 --> 19:29.315
Are you done with school?

281
19:32.276 --> 19:34.987
So you're asking me, your teacher, to lie to your dad?

282
19:36.197 --> 19:38.324
[Soyeon] Please, Ms. Kang.

283
19:38.407 --> 19:42.286
If my dad finds out, I'll be in so much trouble.

284
19:42.870 --> 19:45.956
-But still, I can't just-- -I can't quit being a trainee.

285
19:46.040 --> 19:48.876
Just tell him I fainted from anemia.

286
19:49.543 --> 19:52.546
I promise I'll never do it again.

287
19:53.047 --> 19:54.048
Please?

288
19:54.965 --> 19:55.966
[Jisun sighs]

289
19:58.260 --> 20:00.221
Even if I lie for you,

290
20:01.263 --> 20:04.016
your dad's going to check with the doctor.

291
20:07.394 --> 20:10.648
Then I'll talk to my dad.

292
20:17.404 --> 20:20.407
[line ringing]

293
20:21.492 --> 20:23.202
[automated voice] The call cannot be connected. Please…

294
20:23.285 --> 20:26.539
ANESTHESIOLOGY

295
20:26.622 --> 20:28.040
-Hello. -[nurse] Yes, hello.

296
20:28.123 --> 20:30.626
I'm a family member of Dr. Kang Jieun in Anesthesiology.

297
20:30.709 --> 20:32.461
She's not answering her phone.

298
20:32.545 --> 20:34.797
Could you check if she's in surgery right now?

299
20:34.880 --> 20:35.881
[nurse] One moment, please.

300
20:38.008 --> 20:41.387
Dr. Kang Jieun went into surgery a little while ago.

301
20:42.721 --> 20:43.931
How long will it take?

302
20:44.849 --> 20:46.642
[nurse] At least five hours.

303
20:48.060 --> 20:49.061
[Jisun] Oh.

304
20:50.062 --> 20:51.313
Okay.

305
21:00.865 --> 21:03.117
[♪ unsettling music plays]

306
21:11.542 --> 21:13.168
[♪ ambient music plays]

307
21:14.378 --> 21:18.048
Where do you see yourself in three years?

308
21:20.759 --> 21:21.760
[Jisun hums]

309
21:23.971 --> 21:26.682
First, I hope I'll have a permanent teaching position.

310
21:28.350 --> 21:31.478
Then my life will be more stable than it is now.

311
21:32.646 --> 21:37.735
And every school break, I'll travel somewhere I love.

312
21:37.818 --> 21:43.198
Like, spending a month in Canada, where Anne of Green Gables is set.

313
21:44.366 --> 21:45.367
[Junho] Hmm.

314
21:46.702 --> 21:48.454
What would you do there?

315
21:50.497 --> 21:52.041
Read Anne of Green Gables again?

316
21:52.124 --> 21:54.627
[both chuckle]

317
21:55.377 --> 21:56.962
-That's cool. -Sounds nice, right?

318
21:57.838 --> 21:59.673
-[Jisun laughs] -What else?

319
21:59.757 --> 22:00.758
[Jisun hums]

320
22:02.092 --> 22:06.347
I'd also love to spend a whole month surfing at Waikiki Beach in Hawaii.

321
22:06.430 --> 22:07.431
[Junho] Oh.

322
22:07.514 --> 22:09.558
I'd love to walk the Camino de Santiago too,

323
22:09.642 --> 22:11.101
and if I get the chance,

324
22:11.185 --> 22:13.520
I'd like to see the northern lights in Iceland.

325
22:14.313 --> 22:17.399
[inhales sharply, hums]

326
22:17.483 --> 22:19.485
I hope you don't mind me asking, but…

327
22:21.528 --> 22:23.822
it sounds like you haven't given much thought

328
22:24.531 --> 22:27.493
to sharing your life with someone.

329
22:30.371 --> 22:31.538
You mean, marriage?

330
22:40.047 --> 22:41.715
If I'm lucky, I guess.

331
22:46.053 --> 22:48.263
If I meet someone I don't want to let go of.

332
22:53.185 --> 22:56.981
You never know what's around the corner in life.

333
23:06.365 --> 23:08.367
[♪ tense music plays]

334
23:22.756 --> 23:24.591
[Junho] Whatever Soyeon's circumstances are…

335
23:27.261 --> 23:28.846
it has nothing to do with Hyunsoo.

336
23:32.016 --> 23:35.269
And what exactly do we gain by telling Soyeon's father the truth?

337
23:37.396 --> 23:40.357
Is it really right for a young student

338
23:40.441 --> 23:43.068
to lose her chance to pursue her dream over one mistake?

339
23:43.152 --> 23:44.153
[Junho scoffs]

340
23:46.113 --> 23:48.073
You got caught lying to me.

341
23:49.283 --> 23:50.993
And now you're asking me to lie too?

342
23:53.912 --> 23:56.874
I think she should take responsibility for what she did.

343
23:58.333 --> 24:02.337
I don't want to teach her to lie her way out

344
24:02.421 --> 24:06.175
of taking responsibility for her actions like someone else I know.

345
24:08.052 --> 24:09.136
Excuse me?

346
24:09.219 --> 24:10.929
[Junho] Think about your own actions.

347
24:11.513 --> 24:13.849
What you did impulsively after drinking.

348
24:13.932 --> 24:15.392
Now you've suddenly turned on me.

349
24:15.476 --> 24:17.770
And you're trying to dump all the blame onto me.

350
24:18.437 --> 24:19.438
Or…

351
24:22.274 --> 24:23.942
maybe there's something else you want.

352
24:29.865 --> 24:31.033
Mr. Min Junho.

353
24:33.494 --> 24:35.079
You can't fool me.

354
24:37.206 --> 24:40.250
On the outside, you're a successful man, a respected doctor,

355
24:40.334 --> 24:42.503
and a father who seems perfectly normal, but…

356
24:47.049 --> 24:48.050
on the inside…

357
24:49.510 --> 24:51.887
you're nothing but a despicable criminal.

358
24:58.644 --> 24:59.645
Jisun.

359
25:01.772 --> 25:02.773
I'm…

360
25:04.983 --> 25:07.111
not the kind of person you think I am.

361
25:10.280 --> 25:11.365
I'm really not.

362
25:36.598 --> 25:37.599
Soyeon!

363
25:43.021 --> 25:44.022
Are you okay?

364
25:44.106 --> 25:45.858
Don't worry. She's okay.

365
25:45.941 --> 25:48.902
Ms. Kang, what happened?

366
25:50.154 --> 25:52.197
-Well… -[Soyeon's dad sighs]

367
25:52.281 --> 25:53.615
[Junho] Hello.

368
25:53.699 --> 25:55.617
Are you Soyeon's father?

369
25:56.326 --> 25:57.327
[Soyeon's dad] Yes.

370
25:57.411 --> 26:00.080
[Junho inhales sharply] Well, it looks like Soyeon…

371
26:02.875 --> 26:05.335
may have pushed herself a little too hard with practice.

372
26:06.420 --> 26:09.339
We ran some blood tests, and nothing unusual came up.

373
26:09.423 --> 26:10.674
She's just exhausted.

374
26:11.592 --> 26:13.927
It can happen sometimes at her age.

375
26:15.721 --> 26:19.933
Luckily, her teacher here took good care of her.

376
26:22.477 --> 26:23.478
[Soyeon's dad] Oh.

377
26:24.563 --> 26:26.106
-Thank you. -[Jisun] Sure.

378
26:26.690 --> 26:28.901
[Soyeon's dad] Is there anything we need to watch out for?

379
26:29.568 --> 26:32.279
She'll be fine after a few days of rest and good food.

380
26:32.362 --> 26:34.990
Most importantly, try to make sure she can relax.

381
26:35.574 --> 26:38.327
-[Soyeon's dad] Okay. Thank you. -Of course.

382
26:39.119 --> 26:40.120
[Soyeon's dad] Geez.

383
26:40.621 --> 26:43.373
Why do you have to make me worry like this?

384
26:44.124 --> 26:46.043
I told you not to overdo it.

385
26:46.752 --> 26:48.170
Seriously…

386
26:48.712 --> 26:50.672
Are you sure you feel okay?

387
26:51.215 --> 26:53.634
Look at you. Honestly.

388
26:53.717 --> 26:55.010
[♪ pensive music plays]

389
26:58.555 --> 27:01.808
[instructor] Getting out to the lineup isn't easy.

390
27:02.309 --> 27:05.395
You have to fight through the smaller waves,

391
27:05.479 --> 27:08.815
dodge the big ones, and keep paddling until you're out back.

392
27:09.650 --> 27:13.278
Today, we're going to learn how to get through those bigger waves.

393
27:13.362 --> 27:14.780
It's called a duck dive.

394
27:16.073 --> 27:17.157
Shall we give it a try?

395
27:20.619 --> 27:22.079
Just as the name suggests,

396
27:22.162 --> 27:24.790
you duck under the water like a duck

397
27:24.873 --> 27:27.250
to pass right beneath the wave.

398
27:28.043 --> 27:29.378
The most important thing is…

399
27:30.545 --> 27:34.007
you've got to dive under right as the wave reaches its highest point.

400
27:35.550 --> 27:37.636
Go too early, and you'll just get swept back.

401
27:39.888 --> 27:40.889
Go too late…

402
27:40.973 --> 27:42.766
[♪ ominous music plays]

403
27:46.353 --> 27:47.646
…and you'll get flipped over.

404
28:28.937 --> 28:31.273
-Are you having any discomfort? -[patient] Not at all.

405
28:31.356 --> 28:33.358
I feel so much better now.

406
28:34.693 --> 28:38.030
Your biopsy results show no signs of rejection,

407
28:38.113 --> 28:39.948
and your heart rate looks good too.

408
28:40.032 --> 28:41.241
The surgery went very well.

409
28:41.324 --> 28:44.619
My gosh, Dr. Min, you saved my life.

410
28:44.703 --> 28:47.289
You're a lifesaver!

411
28:47.372 --> 28:50.000
-You did great getting through surgery. -[patient] Gosh, thank you.

412
28:55.297 --> 28:56.423
Hyunsoo.

413
29:02.179 --> 29:03.263
What's up?

414
29:06.975 --> 29:09.394
I wanted to talk to you.

415
29:12.689 --> 29:15.525
If it's not important, let's talk later.

416
29:16.109 --> 29:17.569
[Hyunsoo] Is it because of my dad?

417
29:24.242 --> 29:25.368
What do you mean?

418
29:28.455 --> 29:30.540
I thought we were friends,

419
29:32.209 --> 29:34.544
but I thought you might've changed because of my dad.

420
29:36.630 --> 29:37.839
What are you talking about?

421
29:37.923 --> 29:39.174
My dad really didn't do it.

422
29:40.092 --> 29:42.135
The police said he was innocent.

423
29:42.219 --> 29:44.971
And a lie detector test said he was telling the truth.

424
29:45.055 --> 29:47.265
They said that woman approached him for his money.

425
29:49.851 --> 29:51.812
-Who told you that? -My dad's the victim.

426
29:52.562 --> 29:54.439
-Wait… -She's the one who did him wrong.

427
29:58.276 --> 29:59.361
[Jisun breathes shakily]

428
30:02.322 --> 30:03.573
Let's talk later…

429
30:06.368 --> 30:07.911
Let's talk about this another time.

430
30:10.122 --> 30:11.123
[door opens]

431
30:12.707 --> 30:13.708
[door closes]

432
30:15.293 --> 30:16.545
Hyunsoo.

433
30:24.094 --> 30:25.095
Never mind.

434
30:25.679 --> 30:26.930
I'll see you in class.

435
30:31.017 --> 30:32.018
[door closes]

436
30:36.439 --> 30:38.150
[water running]

437
30:46.116 --> 30:48.618
[♪ unsettling music plays]

438
30:54.499 --> 30:55.500
[glass shatters]

439
30:56.084 --> 30:57.252
[♪ ambient music plays]

440
31:01.047 --> 31:02.883
-[guest] Oh, my gosh. I'm so sorry. -[server] Are you okay?

441
31:02.966 --> 31:03.967
Sorry about that.

442
31:04.050 --> 31:06.803
-Let me get it for you. -It slipped out of my hand. I'm sorry.

443
31:13.685 --> 31:14.769
Are you okay?

444
31:14.853 --> 31:19.941
Ah, I can't look at broken glass.

445
31:20.025 --> 31:22.360
It makes me picture someone getting cut and bleeding.

446
31:25.655 --> 31:27.365
Doesn't seeing blood bother you?

447
31:30.285 --> 31:34.581
I can't let it bother me. I am a doctor, after all.

448
31:37.167 --> 31:39.753
Do you try not to feel anything if you can help it?

449
31:42.214 --> 31:44.424
It's more that

450
31:44.507 --> 31:50.013
I solemnly swore to dedicate my life to serving humanity.

451
31:52.807 --> 31:54.476
[chuckles]

452
31:57.312 --> 31:59.147
So is there anything that scares you?

453
31:59.231 --> 32:00.857
[objects clatter]

454
32:00.941 --> 32:02.859
[♪ unsettling music plays]

455
32:07.822 --> 32:09.783
[Junho] Anything that scares me?

456
32:14.704 --> 32:16.957
After my wife passed away,

457
32:17.040 --> 32:19.417
Hyunsoo and I started living on our own.

458
32:20.126 --> 32:22.337
Then one day, out of nowhere,

459
32:22.420 --> 32:24.547
we started hearing noises outside the door.

460
32:25.632 --> 32:29.844
Hyunsoo said he thought his mom wanted to come inside.

461
32:33.390 --> 32:36.935
We have this black horse statue outside our place

462
32:37.018 --> 32:39.354
that my wife bought to protect the house.

463
32:40.313 --> 32:44.067
One day, Hyunsoo put our house key under it.

464
32:45.318 --> 32:49.072
And strangely enough, we haven't heard the noises since.

465
32:50.824 --> 32:53.326
[Junghyeon] Drugs to commit a crime and a wife dead from an overdose.

466
32:53.410 --> 32:55.078
Isn't that too much of a coincidence?

467
32:56.121 --> 32:58.999
If a medical professional is determined, there's no stopping them.

468
33:00.500 --> 33:03.962
Who knows what kind of drugs that bastard might have hidden in his house?

469
33:07.382 --> 33:10.302
What does the surgery schedule look like on Thursday?

470
33:11.553 --> 33:13.805
[nurse] There's one scheduled for 11:30 a.m.

471
33:13.888 --> 33:15.557
Is that the earliest?

472
33:16.266 --> 33:19.311
-That's the earliest we have that day. -[Junho] Hmm.

473
33:24.357 --> 33:25.900
[chuckles]

474
33:31.656 --> 33:33.325
[♪ tense music plays]

475
34:02.020 --> 34:07.525
DISPOSABLE SHOE COVERS

476
34:36.721 --> 34:38.014
[Junho clears throat]

477
34:50.235 --> 34:52.362
Where did Yunji go?

478
34:53.029 --> 34:55.240
I brought her some chocolate.

479
34:57.242 --> 35:01.329
Well, no one's here, so I guess I'll just have to eat it myself.

480
35:01.413 --> 35:03.498
No, you can't, Dr. Min!

481
35:06.000 --> 35:07.335
-Liar. -[door slides]

482
35:07.419 --> 35:08.753
[Yunji's mom] Hello, Dr. Min.

483
35:09.462 --> 35:13.675
[Junho] Ma'am, I think Yunji's the liar here.

484
35:13.758 --> 35:14.801
Look at this.

485
35:15.719 --> 35:19.264
She kept refusing to take her medicine, so I bought her just one.

486
35:19.347 --> 35:21.182
So you're the culprit.

487
35:21.266 --> 35:23.309
Caught red-handed.

488
35:23.393 --> 35:25.937
Absolutely no more of these until after the surgery.

489
35:27.897 --> 35:29.774
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

490
36:22.994 --> 36:24.954
[doorbell rings]

491
36:50.021 --> 36:51.856
I guess he's unhappy with everything I do.

492
36:53.191 --> 36:55.652
He tells me not to use his birthday as the door code,

493
36:55.735 --> 36:57.946
not to make him breakfast without asking…

494
37:00.073 --> 37:02.492
FULL NAME: MIN, HYUNSOO DATE OF BIRTH: NOVEMBER 3, 2015

495
37:05.995 --> 37:06.996
[shutter clicks]

496
37:23.471 --> 37:24.472
[lock beeps]

497
37:31.938 --> 37:33.064
[door unlocks]

498
37:45.785 --> 37:47.996
Yunji's surgery is next week, right?

499
37:48.079 --> 37:49.247
[nurse] Yes, Thursday.

500
37:50.039 --> 37:52.876
Please make sure her blood sugar stays under 140 mg.

501
37:53.459 --> 37:56.504
She's a child, so it'll probably be harder to keep it under control.

502
37:57.005 --> 37:58.047
[nurse] Will do.

503
37:59.674 --> 38:01.676
You ended up staying late because of Yunji.

504
38:01.759 --> 38:02.760
[sighs]

505
38:03.261 --> 38:04.512
Well, she's my patient.

506
38:05.513 --> 38:06.556
See you tomorrow.

507
38:07.640 --> 38:09.642
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

508
38:15.857 --> 38:16.858
[door locks]

509
38:27.911 --> 38:28.912
[lock beeps]

510
38:37.086 --> 38:38.087
[lock beeps]

511
38:41.716 --> 38:43.885
[Junho] We have this black horse statue outside our place

512
38:43.968 --> 38:45.803
-that my wife bought to protect the house. -[♪ tense music plays]

513
38:46.387 --> 38:50.308
One day, Hyunsoo put our house key under it.

514
39:12.330 --> 39:13.414
[vehicle approaching]

515
39:26.302 --> 39:27.303
[doorbell rings]

516
39:42.819 --> 39:43.820
[rustling]

517
39:43.903 --> 39:46.322
POSTAL DELIVERY

518
39:48.908 --> 39:50.159
[motorcycle engine starts]

519
39:50.243 --> 39:52.245
[motorcycle departing]

520
39:53.621 --> 39:54.622
[sighs]

521
40:05.425 --> 40:06.426
[door unlocks]

522
40:17.812 --> 40:19.480
[♪ tense music plays]

523
40:43.838 --> 40:44.964
30 MIN 26 KM

524
40:45.048 --> 40:48.760
[GPS chimes] Sharp turn ahead. Please drive safely.

525
40:59.062 --> 41:00.063
[objects clatter]

526
41:32.720 --> 41:37.100
[radio host] Meanwhile, strong winds are expected in parts of the east coast,

527
41:37.183 --> 41:40.311
so secure any outdoor structures and take extra care to avoid accidents.

528
42:27.108 --> 42:29.152
[automated voice] A vehicle has arrived.

529
43:07.648 --> 43:09.650
[♪ ominous music plays]

530
43:12.695 --> 43:13.696
Damn it.

531
43:23.039 --> 43:24.040
[car beeps]

532
43:25.541 --> 43:26.542
[music stops]

533
43:31.130 --> 43:32.131
[♪ unsettling music plays]

534
43:58.824 --> 44:01.953
[keypad beeping]

535
44:18.552 --> 44:19.553
[phone chimes]

536
44:26.435 --> 44:28.062
[guard] Hello, this is the management office.

537
44:28.145 --> 44:31.107
We have some mail here for you, so please come by to pick it up.

538
44:33.192 --> 44:34.527
[♪ unsettling music plays]

539
44:53.462 --> 44:54.463
-[Jisun] Oh! -[clattering]

540
44:57.675 --> 44:59.051
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

541
45:17.361 --> 45:20.573
MAIL DELIVERY NOTICE WE ATTEMPTED DELIVERY AT 5:45 P.M.

542
45:32.084 --> 45:33.085
[Jisun sighs]

543
45:52.438 --> 45:53.564
[♪ unsettling music plays]

544
46:21.509 --> 46:22.635
[grunts]

545
46:26.722 --> 46:30.643
-Brad! Where are you going? Get back here! -[dog barks]

546
46:31.769 --> 46:34.188
Oh, Dr. Min! Grab my dog, please!

547
46:35.189 --> 46:36.440
Hey, Brad!

548
46:37.066 --> 46:38.067
Darn it.

549
46:41.153 --> 46:42.154
[Jisun grunts]

550
46:55.751 --> 46:57.169
[Junho] Hey, hold on.

551
46:59.922 --> 47:01.257
[laughs] Hey, why did you…

552
47:18.691 --> 47:20.317
[neighbor] I would've chased him around all day

553
47:20.401 --> 47:21.819
-if it weren't for you. -[Junho] I know.

554
47:21.902 --> 47:23.654
How old is he?

555
47:23.737 --> 47:25.614
-[neighbor] He's turning five. -[Junho] Gosh, you…

556
47:29.118 --> 47:31.996
-[neighbor] Isn't he handsome? [laughs] -[Junho chuckles] You're so cute.

557
47:32.079 --> 47:34.206
[neighbor] He never listens to me. Honestly…

558
47:34.874 --> 47:36.000
I'll see you around.

559
47:36.083 --> 47:37.084
-[neighbor] Sure. -[Junho] Okay.

560
47:37.168 --> 47:38.627
-[neighbor] Thank you so much. -[Junho] No problem.

561
47:38.711 --> 47:39.962
-[neighbor] Have a good one. -[Junho] Goodbye.

562
47:40.045 --> 47:41.088
[neighbor] See you around.

563
47:51.932 --> 47:52.933
[sighs]

564
47:55.769 --> 47:56.854
[♪ music intensifies]

565
48:09.575 --> 48:11.785
[door locks]

566
48:17.416 --> 48:18.542
[♪ unsettling music plays]

567
48:35.309 --> 48:36.310
[object clatters]

568
49:40.207 --> 49:41.208
[exhales sharply]

569
49:53.846 --> 49:54.847
Huh?

570
50:01.228 --> 50:03.147
[gasps] Where did it go?

571
50:04.523 --> 50:05.524
[truck honking]

572
50:15.492 --> 50:16.410
Damn it.

573
50:16.493 --> 50:17.536
[Hyunsoo] What's this?

574
50:18.454 --> 50:20.247
-Why? -It's steak.

575
50:20.956 --> 50:22.249
Nice surprise, huh?

576
50:22.333 --> 50:23.375
Steak or people,

577
50:23.459 --> 50:25.878
it's nicest when they come out of nowhere.

578
50:25.961 --> 50:27.421
I'm not that excited.

579
50:27.504 --> 50:29.214
Say, "I love you, Dad," before you eat.

580
50:29.298 --> 50:30.966
Thanks for the food.

581
50:31.050 --> 50:32.051
[Junho scoffs]

582
50:33.344 --> 50:34.928
[siren blaring in the distance]

583
50:39.266 --> 50:40.601
[Hyunsoo] I wonder what's going on.

584
50:41.185 --> 50:42.186
[doorbell rings]

585
50:56.825 --> 50:58.160
What's going on?

586
50:58.243 --> 50:59.620
[detective] Mr. Min Junho?

587
50:59.703 --> 51:00.788
[Junho] Yes.

588
51:00.871 --> 51:02.122
I asked what's going on.

589
51:02.706 --> 51:04.458
[detective] We received a tip about drug possession.

590
51:05.626 --> 51:07.044
A tip about drug possession?

591
51:11.006 --> 51:12.007
[sighs]

592
51:16.136 --> 51:17.262
[♪ tense music plays]

593
51:22.101 --> 51:23.102
[rustling]

594
51:26.313 --> 51:27.314
What's this?

595
51:28.982 --> 51:31.902
Wait, how did you know you'd find this?

596
51:40.744 --> 51:41.745
Hyunsoo.

597
51:42.287 --> 51:44.665
It's nothing. There's been a misunderstanding.

598
51:44.748 --> 51:47.668
I'll be back soon, so don't worry. Just go inside.

599
51:50.295 --> 51:51.296
[car door closes]

600
51:51.797 --> 51:52.798
[car engine starts]

601
51:53.966 --> 51:55.384
Go on in, okay?

602
52:13.944 --> 52:14.945
[exhales sharply]

603
52:18.198 --> 52:19.199
[siren blaring]

604
52:19.825 --> 52:21.285
Let me make a phone call.

605
52:31.962 --> 52:35.674
[phone ringing]

606
52:44.600 --> 52:45.851
Hello?

607
52:45.934 --> 52:48.228
[caller] Hello. Is this Ms. Kang Jisun?

608
52:49.646 --> 52:50.647
Who is this?

609
52:52.441 --> 52:53.734
The police suddenly showed up

610
52:53.817 --> 52:55.944
after getting a report and found medicine vials.

611
52:56.028 --> 52:57.696
-I'm on my way to the station now. -[♪ tense music plays]

612
52:59.364 --> 53:00.657
Sangcheon Police Station.

613
53:04.703 --> 53:05.746
Okay.

614
53:09.458 --> 53:10.459
[line disconnects]

615
53:12.878 --> 53:13.921
My lawyer.

616
53:19.802 --> 53:21.720
Who gave you the tip?

617
53:21.804 --> 53:26.183
I'm afraid I can't disclose that due to our policy of protecting sources.

618
53:26.266 --> 53:27.893
Why don't we meet and talk in person?

619
53:27.976 --> 53:30.354
I don't want to do an interview or anything like that.

620
53:30.437 --> 53:32.523
This isn't just about you.

621
53:32.606 --> 53:33.899
There are many women like you

622
53:33.982 --> 53:36.026
-who get branded as gold diggers-- -No, thanks.

623
53:36.109 --> 53:37.110
[line disconnects]

624
53:40.864 --> 53:42.991
I knew this was going to happen to you.

625
53:43.075 --> 53:46.286
They say an anonymous woman tipped them off. It's obvious who it was.

626
53:46.370 --> 53:47.371
[Junho] Who was it?

627
53:51.291 --> 53:54.920
Hey. You said that woman's claiming she was drugged.

628
53:55.003 --> 53:58.549
So who do you think reported that you had drugs in your house?

629
53:59.424 --> 54:00.592
There's no way…

630
54:00.676 --> 54:01.677
[attorney] Seriously?

631
54:01.760 --> 54:03.720
Geez, you really are naive and clueless.

632
54:04.763 --> 54:07.724
The police searched under the bed as soon as they came in.

633
54:07.808 --> 54:08.934
They knew where to look.

634
54:09.017 --> 54:10.853
There's no way she could've known that.

635
54:11.436 --> 54:13.647
Those narcotics detectives are bloodhounds.

636
54:13.730 --> 54:16.692
The second they walk into a place, they know exactly where to look.

637
54:18.277 --> 54:19.611
[Junho sighs]

638
54:19.695 --> 54:21.697
Your neighbors saw you get taken away, right?

639
54:24.366 --> 54:25.576
[Junho] Yeah.

640
54:25.659 --> 54:26.660
Hyunsoo saw too?

641
54:30.455 --> 54:31.456
[sighs]

642
54:33.375 --> 54:35.711
This is just the beginning, okay?

643
54:36.336 --> 54:38.130
I told you, that woman's a pro.

644
54:38.755 --> 54:41.049
She'll demand a reinvestigation, file false reports,

645
54:41.133 --> 54:43.969
feed people false tips, spread rumors, and take this all the way.

646
54:47.931 --> 54:48.932
Still…

647
54:49.933 --> 54:51.602
I don't want to press charges.

648
54:53.228 --> 54:54.730
She's Hyunsoo's teacher.

649
54:56.857 --> 55:00.902
[attorney] Then let's at least get a story out there, okay?

650
55:00.986 --> 55:02.404
I know a reporter.

651
55:02.487 --> 55:05.490
He loves sensational stuff and lives for clicks.

652
55:05.574 --> 55:06.575
He's good.

653
55:06.658 --> 55:08.076
[sighs]

654
55:08.160 --> 55:09.161
Come on.

655
55:09.244 --> 55:12.414
We need to get something in the press to keep her in check.

656
55:12.497 --> 55:14.541
-Why won't you listen to me? -[door opens]

657
55:16.043 --> 55:17.169
All done?

658
55:17.711 --> 55:20.172
[detective] Oh, here. Have one each.

659
55:21.423 --> 55:23.258
-No, thank you. -[detective chuckles]

660
55:24.217 --> 55:28.138
Just sign here, and you're free to go.

661
55:28.221 --> 55:32.726
You had this so nicely tucked away, you ended up coming for no reason.

662
55:34.227 --> 55:35.312
Can I go now?

663
55:35.395 --> 55:37.814
Yes. Don't forget to take these insulin vials with you.

664
55:39.149 --> 55:40.442
Take care.

665
55:40.942 --> 55:42.027
-[attorney] Bye. -Bye.

666
55:44.196 --> 55:45.656
Geez…

667
55:54.081 --> 55:55.916
QUASI-RAPE

668
55:55.999 --> 55:58.377
…NO CHARGES…

669
55:58.460 --> 56:01.546
…DECIDED NOT TO REFER THE CASE…

670
56:08.929 --> 56:09.930
[door closes]

671
56:15.852 --> 56:17.145
Dad, are you okay?

672
56:31.618 --> 56:33.870
When your mom was pregnant with you,

673
56:34.579 --> 56:36.748
she had gestational diabetes.

674
56:38.500 --> 56:41.670
She was treated for it for a few years even after you were born.

675
56:42.796 --> 56:46.883
I forgot to throw out some insulin vials that were left over from back then.

676
56:48.719 --> 56:50.470
Did we bring them with us when we moved?

677
56:52.848 --> 56:55.183
I don't know. I guess it came along with something.

678
56:56.643 --> 56:59.396
But that's not what's important.

679
56:59.479 --> 57:00.897
[♪ soft music plays]

680
57:00.981 --> 57:02.315
Then what is?

681
57:05.736 --> 57:06.987
You and me.

682
57:11.116 --> 57:14.828
On my way to the police station, I realized something.

683
57:17.497 --> 57:21.793
When your mom was unwell, I was so focused on her

684
57:22.794 --> 57:26.256
that I didn't give you enough hugs.

685
57:27.799 --> 57:30.469
So I figured I'd better make up for it now.

686
57:31.052 --> 57:32.637
[Hyunsoo] Gross.

687
57:33.263 --> 57:37.225
Just deal with it. I'm putting up with how gross this is too.

688
57:40.145 --> 57:41.146
[Hyunsoo] Dad.

689
57:42.063 --> 57:43.064
[Junho] Yeah?

690
57:46.777 --> 57:48.862
So something like that will never happen again?

691
57:51.198 --> 57:52.199
[Junho] No.

692
57:56.870 --> 57:57.871
[door closes]

693
58:05.462 --> 58:06.797
[line ringing]

694
58:07.714 --> 58:08.715
It's me.

695
58:09.466 --> 58:10.592
I changed my mind.

696
58:11.968 --> 58:13.804
Who's that reporter you mentioned?

697
58:14.721 --> 58:15.722
Oh, no.

698
58:15.806 --> 58:18.683
Another teacher tried to take their life because of depression.

699
58:18.767 --> 58:20.769
The parents filed 14 complaints,

700
58:20.852 --> 58:23.104
claiming they violated their child's rights.

701
58:23.188 --> 58:24.981
Don't follow the news.

702
58:25.065 --> 58:27.776
These days, going online just makes you feel worse.

703
58:27.859 --> 58:28.860
For you.

704
58:28.944 --> 58:32.072
I really don't know what's happening to the world these days.

705
58:32.155 --> 58:33.490
-[teacher 1] Tell me about it. -[teacher 2] Goodness.

706
58:35.116 --> 58:37.035
Oh, my gosh. What is this?

707
58:37.118 --> 58:39.037
-[teacher 3] What is it? -[teacher 1] Why? What is it?

708
58:42.791 --> 58:46.169
Damn, this is insane!

709
58:46.253 --> 58:48.129
Hey, check this out.

710
58:49.297 --> 58:50.340
-What is it? -Let's see.

711
58:50.423 --> 58:52.259
-[Sanghyeon] Is this for real? -[student] Isn't this our school?

712
58:52.342 --> 58:53.677
[Sanghyeon] Right?

713
58:53.760 --> 58:56.221
Looks like it, right? This isn't fake news, is it?

714
58:56.304 --> 58:57.305
[teacher gasps]

715
58:59.808 --> 59:02.769
An elementary school in Sangcheon that starts with S…

716
59:02.853 --> 59:03.895
Isn't that us?

717
59:03.979 --> 59:06.147
Forget the S. We're the only prestigious school…

718
59:06.231 --> 59:07.732
Wait, let me see.

719
59:09.067 --> 59:11.653
All right, everyone. Take your seats.

720
59:12.404 --> 59:14.906
-[Sanghyeon] Ms. Kang, you're in the news. -[student] Hey, don't…

721
59:15.448 --> 59:16.741
Me?

722
59:16.825 --> 59:19.077
[teacher 1] A contract Korean teacher?

723
59:19.160 --> 59:20.495
[teacher 2] Korean?

724
59:21.830 --> 59:23.290
Korean?

725
59:23.373 --> 59:25.917
The one that teaches reading and writing. Ms. Kang!

726
59:26.710 --> 59:27.878
That's right.

727
59:28.670 --> 59:31.047
Ms. Kang, are you a gold digger?

728
59:31.131 --> 59:32.799
-[student] Hey. -Hey, you can't say that.

729
59:32.883 --> 59:34.384
It says so right here.

730
59:36.845 --> 59:38.054
[♪ unsettling music plays]

731
59:38.138 --> 59:39.806
[Sanghyeon] I didn't think she was like that.

732
59:42.642 --> 59:45.729
WOMEN WHO USE SEX AS A WEAPON, SUSPICIOUS BEHAVIOR OF CONTRACT TEACHER

733
59:45.812 --> 59:47.230
That woman was you?

734
59:51.902 --> 59:53.987
[phone buzzing]

735
01:00:02.412 --> 01:00:04.915
[buzzing continues]

736
01:00:14.174 --> 01:00:15.175
[students chattering]

737
01:00:15.759 --> 01:00:16.801
[student 1] I guess it's true.

738
01:00:16.885 --> 01:00:18.219
-Hey, I guess it's really true. -[student 2] Yeah.

739
01:00:32.442 --> 01:00:35.153
[high-pitched ringing]

740
01:00:52.003 --> 01:00:53.004
[water running]

741
01:01:22.200 --> 01:01:23.994
Looking for something?

742
01:01:24.077 --> 01:01:25.412
Oh.

743
01:01:25.495 --> 01:01:27.664
I came to drop off the notice.

744
01:01:32.085 --> 01:01:34.295
WOMEN &amp; JUVENILE AFFAIRS DIVISION

745
01:01:34.379 --> 01:01:36.464
Has a decision been made?

746
01:01:37.882 --> 01:01:38.883
Yes.

747
01:01:39.384 --> 01:01:42.721
We've decided not to refer the case for prosecution due to lack of evidence.

748
01:01:46.850 --> 01:01:47.976
[exhales deeply]

749
01:01:50.311 --> 01:01:51.312
Then…

750
01:01:52.897 --> 01:01:54.274
it's over now.

751
01:01:55.817 --> 01:01:59.738
I apologize for the inconvenience we've caused.

752
01:02:00.864 --> 01:02:01.865
[Junho sighs]

753
01:02:04.659 --> 01:02:06.745
Let me ask you one last question.

754
01:02:09.497 --> 01:02:11.249
What happened that night with Ms. Kang…

755
01:02:12.542 --> 01:02:13.626
Do you regret it?

756
01:02:16.296 --> 01:02:17.297
No.

757
01:02:17.797 --> 01:02:19.299
I didn't do anything wrong,

758
01:02:20.050 --> 01:02:21.342
so I have nothing to regret.

759
01:02:25.055 --> 01:02:26.056
Understood.

760
01:02:27.265 --> 01:02:30.101
I hope you don't find yourself in a similar situation again.

761
01:02:33.188 --> 01:02:34.439
Goodbye.

762
01:02:37.192 --> 01:02:38.359
Wait, Detective.

763
01:02:46.534 --> 01:02:47.535
Never mind.

764
01:02:48.036 --> 01:02:49.037
What is it?

765
01:02:54.250 --> 01:02:55.502
If you're free,

766
01:02:56.544 --> 01:02:58.213
would you like to get a drink with me?

767
01:02:59.714 --> 01:03:00.757
[♪ unsettling music plays]

768
01:03:01.758 --> 01:03:02.759
Excuse me?

769
01:03:04.719 --> 01:03:05.720
[Junho] Every day…

770
01:03:07.013 --> 01:03:09.474
has been really hard for me lately.

771
01:03:11.017 --> 01:03:12.644
And today's been a long day too.

772
01:03:14.270 --> 01:03:17.107
I just don't feel like celebrating alone.

773
01:03:18.691 --> 01:03:21.152
And I wanted to thank you too--

774
01:03:21.236 --> 01:03:22.529
I'm on duty.

775
01:03:26.533 --> 01:03:27.826
I'll wait until you're off.

776
01:03:27.909 --> 01:03:29.619
I don't socialize…

777
01:03:32.705 --> 01:03:34.582
with people I've investigated.

778
01:03:40.130 --> 01:03:41.131
Okay.

779
01:03:44.175 --> 01:03:46.302
Well, then… Get home safe.

780
01:03:47.345 --> 01:03:48.346
Will do.

781
01:04:10.869 --> 01:04:12.245
[♪ tense music plays]

782
01:04:24.215 --> 01:04:28.136
THE PERFECT LIE

783
01:04:53.119 --> 01:04:54.120
[Jisun screams]

784
01:04:55.079 --> 01:04:56.206
[Jisun] What about me?

785
01:04:57.582 --> 01:04:58.583
YOU'RE FINISHED NOW!

786
01:04:59.125 --> 01:05:00.293
What about my life?

787
01:05:00.376 --> 01:05:03.004
[Junho] Do you have any idea what my son and I are going through?

788
01:05:03.087 --> 01:05:04.672
[Jisun] Call that reporter.

789
01:05:04.756 --> 01:05:07.217
Tell them what you did and how you covered it up.

790
01:05:07.300 --> 01:05:09.469
Please, just stop with those ridiculous lies!

791
01:05:09.552 --> 01:05:10.720
I can't stop.

792
01:05:10.803 --> 01:05:12.597
[Hwayoung] He's a very dangerous man.

793
01:05:13.389 --> 01:05:16.434
[Junho] It looks like someone broke into my house.

794
01:05:17.769 --> 01:05:19.896
[Jisun] If I make it through those waves,

795
01:05:20.563 --> 01:05:22.941
will I be able to get back to the starting point?

796
01:05:39.249 --> 01:05:40.875
THE PERFECT LIE

797
01:05:40.959 --> 01:05:42.961
Translated by Liya Hyunjoo Choi
